Chapter: BvtIronOnly
  cites Uoaix chapter BritainCatalog
  cites Uoaix chapter EconomyCatalog
  cites Uoaix chapter WorldSpawnData
  cites Uoaix chapter WorldSpawnRenown
  cites Uoaix chapter GameVendorBuys
  cites Uoaix chapter CompositeGameRules
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 UOAIX-240: iron is the only manufacturing ore; gold, silver and copper are smelted (station 3) and struck (station 12)
 only, and no expansion ore elemental spawns.
  bio-coin : Integer -> Boolean
  bio-coin (item) = item == 6 | item == 32 | (item >= 63 & item <= 66)
  bio-crafts-coin : List EgRecipe, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  bio-crafts-coin (rs) (i) (acc) = if i >= list-length rs then acc
    else let r = list-at rs i
    in bio-crafts-coin rs (i + 1) (acc + (if r.station /= 3 & r.station /= 12 & (bio-coin r.one | bio-coin r.two | bio-coin r.three) then 1 else 0))
  bio-input-of : List EgRecipe, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  bio-input-of (rs) (item) (i) = if i >= list-length rs then -1 else if (list-at rs i).item == item then (list-at rs i).one else bio-input-of rs item (i + 1)
 The control: a gold-ingot recipe at the smithy (station 1) and one at the mint (station 12), as the test economy no longer
 has one (main 44841 made its jewelry from iron).
  bio-gold : Integer -> List EgRecipe
  bio-gold (unused) = [eg-recipe 43 1 32 1 0 0 0 0 1 0 0, eg-recipe 51 1 32 1 0 0 0 0 12 0 0]
  bio-expansion : Text -> Boolean
  bio-expansion (key) = key == "dullcopperele" | key == "shadowironele" | key == "copperele" | key == "bronzeele" | key == "goldenele" | key == "agapiteele" | key == "veriteele" | key == "valoriteele"
  bio-profiles : List WsProfile, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  bio-profiles (ps) (i) (acc) = if i >= list-length ps then acc else bio-profiles ps (i + 1) (acc + (if bio-expansion (list-at ps i).key then 1 else 0))
  bio-choices : List WsChoice, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  bio-choices (cs) (i) (acc) = if i >= list-length cs then acc else bio-choices cs (i + 1) (acc + (if bio-expansion (list-at cs i).key then 1 else 0))
  bio-groups : List WsGroup, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  bio-groups (gs) (i) (acc) = if i >= list-length gs then acc else bio-groups gs (i + 1) (acc + bio-choices (list-at gs i).choices 0 0)
  bvt-iron-only : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-iron-only (unused) = act
    a <- bvt-check "jewelry (the blacksmith's and the jeweler's ring) is made from iron ingots; the mint still strikes gold coin from gold ingots and smelts gold ore" (bio-input-of (bb-catalog 0).recipes 43 0 == 31 & bio-input-of (bb-catalog 0).recipes 162 0 == 31 & bio-input-of (bb-catalog 0).recipes 51 0 == 32 & bio-input-of (bb-catalog 0).recipes 32 0 == 6 & gvb-material 20 31)
    b <- bvt-check "no server recipe but a smelt or a strike takes gold, silver or copper ore or ingots; the jeweler buys no gold ingot" (bio-crafts-coin (bb-catalog 0).recipes 0 0 == 0 & bio-crafts-coin (bio-gold 0) 0 0 == 1 & bio-crafts-coin (bb-iron-only (bio-gold 0) 0) 0 0 == 0 & (list-at (bb-iron-only (bio-gold 0) 0) 0).one == 31 & (list-at (bb-iron-only (bio-gold 0) 0) 1).one == 32 & not (gvb-material 20 32))
    c <- bvt-check "no expansion ore elemental is a spawn profile, a spawn choice, a renown key or mine kin; the earth elemental still haunts the Britain mine" (bio-profiles (wsd-catalog 0).profiles 0 0 == 0 & bio-groups (wsd-catalog 0).groups 0 0 == 0 & wsr-at "dullcopperele" 0 == -1 & not (cg-ore-kin "dullcopperele") & cg-ore-kin "earthele" & cg-profile-index (wsd-catalog 0).profiles "earthele" 0 >= 0 & bio-groups (cg-ore-ground (wsd-catalog 0)).groups 0 0 == 0)
    a + b + c
  end
